  "reflectionText": "Paul wrote from the cell: the time of my departure has come. I have fought the good fight. I have finished the course. I have kept the faith. The crown of righteousness is stored up. How does it land to look back over a finished life and find that the fight you fought has been the very one you were called to take on?"
